nodes.natural_language:
Let \[f(x) =
\begin{cases}
x^2+9 &\text{if }x<-5, \\
3x-8&\text{if }x\ge-5.
\end{cases}
\]If $f(x)=10$, find the sum of all possible values of $x$. Show that it is 6.

